## #53 tabs (4): CONTROLS SETUP (10005), FLIGHT CONTROLS (10002), AVIONICS (10003), ADVANCED (10001).
## Labels are baked into the images. Order: Back @5, CONTROLS @210, FLIGHT @410, AVIONICS @610, ADVANCED @810.
